  <h2>Engineering the Perfect Microclimate</h2>
  <p>In the world of high-performance activewear, the fabric is the foundation. As a leading <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, Fitclo invests heavily in Fabric R&D to ensure our clients stay ahead of the competition.</p>
  
  <h3>Capillary Action & Fiber Geometry</h3>
  <p>Our latest moisture-wicking fabrics aren't just treated with chemicals; they are engineered at the molecular level. By utilizing non-circular fiber cross-sections (such as X-shaped or Y-shaped fibers), we increase the surface area and create natural capillary channels that pull sweat away from the skin instantly.</p>
  
  <h3>The R&D Testing Protocol</h3>
  <p>Every new batch of fabric undergoes rigorous testing in our Guangzhou lab:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>MMT (Moisture Management Tester):</strong> We measure the one-way transport capacity and the speed of moisture spreading.</li>
    <li><strong>Evaporation Rate Test:</strong> Ensuring the fabric dries 3x faster than standard polyester.</li>
    <li><strong>Air Permeability:</strong> Balancing wind resistance with breathability for high-intensity cardio.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Collaborative Innovation</h3>
  <p>We work as your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong> to develop custom blends—incorporating recycled nylon, silver ion anti-microbial treatments, or cooling minerals directly into the yarn.</p>
</GuideLayout>
